{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35405","headline":"杨花落 · 张乔","name":"杨花落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北斗南回春物老，红英落尽绿尚早。\n韶风澹荡无所依，偏惜垂杨作春好。\n此时可怜杨柳花，萦盈艳曳满人家。\n人家女儿出罗幕，净扫玉除看花落。\n宝环纤手捧更飞，翠羽轻裙承不着。\n历历瑶琴舞袖陈，飞红拂黛怜玉人。\n东园桃李芳已歇，犹有杨花娇暮春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}